\[ x = 27 \]

Thus, the distance from City $A$ where they meet is \boxed{27} miles.  2%|▎         | 1/40 [00:58<37:54, 58.31s/it]  5%|▌         | 2/40 [01:27<26:12, 41.39s/it]  8%|▊         | 3/40 [01:42<18:07, 29.40s/it]
