= ( 0 + (1/3)*6 ) / (1/9 + 1 )

= ( 2 ) / (10/9 ) = 2*(9/10 ) = 18/10 = 1.8

y' = ( - (1/3)*(-1)*0 + (1/3)^2 *6 ) / (1/9 + 1 )

= ( 0 + 6/9 ) / (10/9 )

